# What a store installs: `export-ignore` applies to `git archive`, which is what
# GitHub builds the Composer download from. A store needs the patches, the
# manifests, composer.json and the licence files. The docs are read on GitHub.
/.github           export-ignore
/docs              export-ignore
/tests             export-ignore
/.gitattributes    export-ignore
/.gitignore        export-ignore
/AGENTS.md         export-ignore
/CONTRIBUTING.md   export-ignore
